E010 — Risk-Ranked Coordinator Worklist
Implementation complete: 52 tasks, plus 28 bug tasks from three QC iterations.

Every figure below was measured in the run that wrote this file, on 2026-07-29,
after E006's and E007's merges. Each command's scope is named, because a figure
whose scope is unstated is the defect three of these iterations were about.

